    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-08-04 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- International Competitive Bids have been invited for the supply of 10,000 vials of Tenecteplase Injection 40mg Vial used for people with heart diseases. Three (03) bids have been submitted for the same. The proposal made by the Minister of Health and Mass Media to award the relevant procurement for a sum of USD 3.7 million to the lowest evaluated substantially responsive bidder, M/s. Boehringer Ingelheim India Pvt. Ltd., India (Manufacturer: Boehringer Ingelheim Pharma GmbH & Co\u2011KG, Germany), based on the recommendation of the Standing High-Level Procurement Committee, was approved by the Cabinet."
