    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-07-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Due to the lack of sanitation facilities of proper standard for the use of the public and local and foreign tourists who flock to urban areas daily, the Government has decided to construct sanitation facilities equipped with standard toilet systems. The Urban Development Authority has identified suitable locations for the proposed facilities as per the urban development plans. It is proposed to construct 20 sanitation facilities under the said project, and it is estimated that Rs. 525.29 million will be incurred for the purpose. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing to implement the proposed sanitation facilities construction project at the following locations, was approved by the Cabinet:\r\n\r\n\t\t*\tDemodara Railway Station\r\n\t\t*\tHotel Junction, Sigiriya\r\n\t\t*\tLake Round, Kandy\r\n\t\t*\tGregory Lake, Nuwara Eliya\r\n\t\t*\tKinniya Beach, Trincomalee\r\n\t\t*\tMarble Brach, Trincomalee\r\n\t\t*\tNilaveli Beach Area,Trincomalee\r\n\t\t*\tPassikudah,Batticaloa\r\n\t\t*\tRuwanweliseya car park premises\r\n\t\t*\tLankapura,Polonnaruwa\r\n\t\t*\tKurikaduwan Jetty premises, Jaffna\r\n\t\t*\tHikkaduwa Coastal Gateway Hub\r\n\t\t*\tHiriketiya, Dikwella\r\n\t\t*\tPareiwella Beach park, Tangalle\r\n\t\t*\tNine Arch Bridge, Ella\r\n\t\t*\tMoragolla beach,Beruwala\r\n\t\t*\tRailway station, Mount Lavinia\r\n\t\t*\tNegombo beach park project, Stage I\r\n\t\t*\tBattaramulla Junction\r\n\t\t*\tBadagamuwa Forest Park, Kurunegala"
  },
