    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-04-07 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development to submit the following Regulation/Orders published through the Government Gazette, for approval of Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet.\n\n*\tRegulation made on the revision of the Luxury Tax Threshold on Motor vehicles under the Finance Act, No.35 of 2018, published through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2421/41 dated 2025-01-31.\n\n*\tOrder made under the Excise (Special Provisions) Act, No.13 of 1989, pertaining to the revision of the Excise Duty Rates on electric vehicles, published by the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2421/42 dated 2025-01-31.\n\n*\tOrder made under the Finance Act, No.35 of 2018, pertaining to the extension of the concessionary period granted under the Embarkation Levy\tpublished through the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No.2421/30 dated 2025-01-31."
