    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-03-03 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The contract period of service of retired Major General, H.M.U. Herath presently serving in the Post of Director General of the Disaster Management Centre is due to expire on 2025\u201103\u201107. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Defence, to appoint retired Major General Sampath Kotuwegoda for a period of one (01) year on contract basis, to the Post of Director General of the Disaster Management Centre, which falls vacant from the said date, was approved by the Cabinet."
