    "description": "Food Policy Committee - Meeting No.01",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12858",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-10-14 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Hon. President to re-establish the Food Policy Committee with the composition of the following officials which has been established in terms of the Cabinet decision dated 2022-10-03, so as to enter into appropriate decisions by following a coordination access with all the parties to ensure that the essential goods including food are supplied to market without scarcity and to take necessary steps to control the rising of the cost of living up to a possible extent, was approved by the Cabinet:\n\n(i) \tSecretary to the President (Chairperson)\n(ii)\tSecretary to the Prime Minister\n(iii) \tSecretary, Ministry of Finance, Economic Development, Policy Formulation, Planning and Tourism\n(iv)\tSecretary, Ministry of Energy\n(v) \tSecretary, Ministry of Agriculture, Lands, Livestock, Irrigation, Fisheries and Aquatic Resources\n(vi) \tSecretary, Ministry of Justice, Public Administration, Home Affairs Provincial Councils, Local Government and Labour\n(vii)\tSecretary, Ministry of Trade, Commerce, Food Security, Cooperative  Development, Industry and Entrepreneurship Development\n(viii)\tSecretary, Ministry of Health\n(ix)\tSecretary, Ministry of Transport, Highways, Ports and Civil Aviation\n(x)\tSecretary, Ministry of Environment, Wildlife, Forest Resources, Water  Supply, Plantation and Community Infrastructure"
  },
  {
