    "date_str": "2024-08-12",
    "description": "Construction and Renovation of Houses damaged by disasters including floods and strong winds due to the activation of the Southwest Monsoon",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12742",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-08-12 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- 454,625 individuals of 120,215 families have been affected by the disasters including floods, strong winds which occurred due to the activation of Southwest Monsoon of the country from 2024\u201105\u201115 and 172 complete house damages and 20,075 partial house damages have been reported.  Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as  the Minister of Defence to construct houses for the families of 172 completely destroyed houses in the same place or any other safe place and to grant compensation to 20,075 partially damaged houses, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
