    "description": "Implementation  of  Currency  Exchange  Counters  at  Arrival  Post  Customs\tArea  at  Bandaranaike  International  Airport  (BIA),  Katunayake",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12665",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-15 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- In  terms  of  the  Cabinet  decision  dated  2024-01-08,  Airport  and  Aviation Services  (Sri  Lanka)  (Pvt)  Limited  has  invited  Limited  Competitive  Bids  to implement  the  Currency  Exchange  Counters  at  Arrival  Post  Customs  Area  at Bandaranaike  International  Airport  (BIA),  Katunayake.  05  bids  have  been submitted  for  that.  The  proposal  made  by  the  Minister  of  Ports,  Shipping  and Aviation  to  evaluate  the  said  bids  and  thereafter,  to  award  the  contracts  as  follows  for  a  period  of  three  (03)  years,  based  on  the  recommendations  of  the  Technical  Evaluation  Committee  and  the  Standing  Cabinet Appointed  Procurement  Committee,  was  approved  by  the  Cabinet.\n\n*    Counter  No.  01  -  Sampath  Bank  PLC\n*    Counter  No.  02  -  People's  Bank\n*    Counter  No.  03  -  Commercial  Bank  of  Ceylon  PLC\n*    Counter  No.  04  -  Thomas  Cook  Lanka  (Pvt)  Limited\n*    Counter  No.  05  -  Bank  of  Ceylon"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
