    "doc_id": "2023-12-05-009-en",
    "num": "9",
    "date_str": "2023-12-05",
    "description": "Negotiations of the 12th Round of the Proposed India - Sri Lanka Economic\tand Technology Cooperation Agreement (ETCA)",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12289",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-12-05 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- Negotiations of the 12th Round pertaining to the proposed India - Sri Lanka \tEconomic and Technology Cooperation Agreement (ETCA) has been held in \tColombo from 2023\u201110\u201130 to 2023\u201111\u201101 and in this instance, working groups \tof both parties have reached a consensus pertaining to several fields concerned. \tBoth parties have agreed to hold the 13th Round of Negotiations pertaining to the \tproposed Agreement in India from 2024\u201101\u201108 to 2024\u201101\u201110 and to finalize the \ttechnical level negotiations by March 2024. The Cabinet noted the information \tfurnished by the Hon. President pertaining to the 12th Round of Negotiations."
  },
