    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-12-05 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Cabinet at its meeting held on 2022\u201112\u201112 has granted approval to \tprepare a Bill to amend the fines referred to in the Penal Code in line with the \tcurrent monetary value. Accordingly, the clearance of the Attorney General has \tbeen received to the Bill prepared by the Legal Draftsman. As such, the \tproposal made by the Minister of Justice, Prison Affairs and Constitutional \tReforms to publish the said Bill in the Government Gazette and submit the same \tthereafter, to Parliament for approval, was approved by the Cabinet."
