    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-05-02",
    "decision_details_body": "- The 73rd Annual Report of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka for the year 2022 hasbeen submitted to the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance,\tEconomic Stabilization and National Policies by the Monetary Board of the\tCentral Bank of Sri Lanka on 2023-04-27. In terms of the provisions in the\tMonetary Law Act, the Annual Report should be submitted by the Minister in\u2011charge  of Finance\tto the Parliament within 14 days of receiving of the said\treport. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as\tthe Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies to \tsubmit the Annual Report of Central Bank of Sri Lanka for the year 2022 to Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
