    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-02-13",
    "decision_details_body": "- It has been proposed to enter into a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) to \t\testablish Political Consultations Mechanism between the Ministry of Foreign \t\tAffairs of Sri Lanka and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Expatriates of the \t\tGovernment of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan. It is expected to promote, \t\tstrengthen and expand bilateral relations between the two countries including \t\tpolitical, economic, consular, technical and scientific and cultural cooperation. \t\tThe approval of the Attorney General has been received for the proposed draft \t\tAgreement. Accordingly, the proposal submitted by the Minister of Foreign \t\tAffairs to sign the said MoU, was approved by the Cabinet."
