    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2023-01-02",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Hon. President in his capacity as the Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies to submit the following Regulations issued under the Imports and Exports (Control) Act, No.1 of 1969, for approval of Parliament, was approved by the Cabinet:\n\n\t* Imports and Exports (Control) Regulations No.23 of 2022  published in\tthe  \tGazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2309/40 dated 2022\u201112\u201109.\n\n\t* Imports and Exports (Control) Regulations No.24 of 2022, published in the \t    Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2311/08 dated 2022\u201112\u201119.\n\n\t* Imports Control Regulations on Payment Terms No.25 of 2022, published in \t   the  Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2311/18 dated 2022\u201112\u201121."
