    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2022-10-31",
    "decision_details_body": "- The Hon. Prime Minister brought to the notice of the Cabinet the following programme proposed for the Budget Debate related to the financial year 2023 and the Cabinet granted its concurrence for the said programme.\n*\tBudget Speech (Second Reading of the Appropriation Bill): 2022\u201111\u201114;\n\n*\tSecond Reading Debate (from 2022\u201111\u201115 to 2022\u201111\u201122 (07 days);\n\n*\tCommittee Stage Debate : from 2022\u201111\u201123 to 2022\u201112\u201108                 (13 days); and\n\n*\tVote: 2022\u201112\u201108"
