    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2022-02-21",
    "decision_details_body": "- In view of improving co\u2011operation and exchange of training, it has been proposed to enter into a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between the Bandaranaike International Diplomatic Training Institute (BIDTI), Sri Lanka and the Sushma Swaraj Institute of Foreign Service (SSIFS), India. Clearance of the Attorney General has been received for the proposed draft MoU. As such, the proposal made by the Foreign Minister to sign the respective MoU, was approved by the Cabinet."
