    "num": "1",
    "date_str": "2021-05-24",
    "description": "Entering into a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between the Open University of Sri Lanka and the Korea National Open University, South Korea",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11069",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2021-05-24",
    "decision_details_body": "- An agreement has been reached between the Open University of Sri Lanka and the Korea National Open University, South Korea to develop collaboration in the fields of open and distance education, capacity building, ICT applications, use of laboratory services, research and publications and staff exchange programmes. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of Education to sign an MoU to that effect, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
    "doc_id": "2021-05-17-007-en",
    "num": "7",
    "date_str": "2021-05-17",
    "description": "Introducing Guidelines for COVID-19 Emergency Procurement Procedure (CEPP)",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=11068",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2021-05-17",
    "decision_details_body": "- Due to the prevailing COVID\u201119 situation, it has been recognized the need for simplifying the existing procurement procedure to procure the essential items required for the Ministry of Health, Ministry of Defence and the State Ministries within the purview of the said Ministries related to the health sector, without delay. As such, the proposal made by the Hon. Prime Minister in his capacity as the Minister of Finance to amend the existing operational procurement procedure and issue new guidelines enabling to purchase vaccines, medical equipment, other medical requirements and essential items expeditiously, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
