    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2020-09-16",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Minister of Energy to award the term contract for the procurement of the 8,400,000 +/-5% barrels of Murban Crude Oil for a period of eight (08) months from 2020\u201110\u201101 to 2021\u201105\u201131 to M/s Emirates National Oil Company (ENOC) of Singapore, as recommended by the Special Standing Cabinet Appointed Procurement Committee, was approved by the Cabinet."
